<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">3 Johan</book>
  <para style="h">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc1">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Johan</para>
  <para style="mt">3 Johan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kricaabu zaehoikung kacoehta mah, loktang ah ka palung ih Kaia khaeah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kang palung ih kami, kahoih poekhaih palungthin na tawnh baktih toengah, hmuennawk boih ah qoengh moe, ngan na tui thai hanah lawk kang thuih pae, tiah ca tarik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Loktang loklam to na pazui moe, loktang lok ah na oh, tiah nawkamyanawk angzoh o moe, ang thuih o naah, paroeai anghoehaih ka tawnh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka caanawk loktang thungah caeh o ti, tiah ka thaih naah, to anghoehaih pongah kalen kue anghoehaih ka tawn ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Palung ih kami, nawkamyanawk hoi angvinnawk khaeah, oep kaom ah tok na sak;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nihcae mah nang ih amlunghaih to kricaabu hmaa ah thuih o boeh: nihcae mah Sithaw koehhaih baktiah tamthanglok taphong o hanah na bomh thaih nahaeloe, kahoih hmuen ah ni om tih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />nihcae loe Anih ih ahmin hoiah ni caeh o, Gentelnawk khae hoi abomhaih tidoeh la o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Loktang toksahkung ah a oh o thai toeng hanah, aicae mah to baktih kaminawk to abomh han oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kricaabu khaeah ca ka tarik: toe nihcae zaehoikung ah kaom, Diotrephe mah kaicae talawk han koeh ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />To pongah, kang zoh nahaeloe, a sak ih hmuen to ka panoek sak han, anih loe aicae kasae thuih khue ai ah, nawkamyanawk doeh talawk han koeh ai: nawkamyanawk talawk han koeh kaminawk doeh pakaa moe, nihcae to kricaabu thung hoiah pathok ving.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Palung ih kami, kahoih ai hmuen to pazui hmah, kahoih hmuen to pazui ah. Kahoih hmuen sah kami loe Sithaw ih kami ah oh: toe kahoih ai hmuen sah kami loe Sithaw to hnu ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kaminawk boih mah Demitria hoihaih kawng to thuih o, loktang lok mah doeh anih hoihaih kawng to thuih: ue, aicae mah doeh kahoihah a thuih o; a thuih o ih lok loe loktang ni, tito na panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ca zetpui tarik han ka koeh, toe cacung hoi catui hoiah tarik ka koeh ai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />nang hoi angqum palang tih hmang, tiah oephaih ka tawnh, to naah mikhmai kang tongah lok aram tih hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang khaeah monghaih om nasoe. Aicae ampuinawk mah ban ang sin o. Toah kaom ampuinawk to ka hmin hoiah ban sin ah.
  </para>
</usx>
